{"id":"n18328-1-9","stage":5,"title":"골동품 · 古董","scene":"文化与休闲","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n18328-1-9-1","ko":"너희 집에는 희귀한 물건들이 많이 있는 것 같아.","zh":"你们家好像有很多稀有的物品呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너희","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们。","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"1","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}},{"text":"집에는","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에는","audio":"/audio/9f31802eb4117b4ea7e7.mp3"}},{"text":"희귀한","meaning":"稀罕，珍惜，稀有，稀少","explanation":"희귀하다：稀罕，珍惜，稀有，稀少；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"희귀하다","audio":"/audio/a413f259a2c7e2b7917f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88474","senseId":"1","lemma":"희귀하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"희귀한","audio":"/audio/02eebd5ca4da323c7724.mp3"}},{"text":"물건들이","meaning":"东西，物品，物件","explanation":"물건：东西，物品，物件；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"물건","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66247","senseId":"1","lemma":"물건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물건들이","audio":"/audio/311a31f0be628ac7a7a6.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代多个听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"a413f259a2c7e2b7","term":"희귀하다","zh":"稀罕，珍惜，稀有，稀少","audio":"/audio/a413f259a2c7e2b7917f.mp3","entryId":"88474","definition":"不多或难以轻易得到而非常独特或珍贵。","pronunciation":["히귀하다"]},{"id":"df279371093362d8","term":"물건","zh":"东西，物品，物件","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3","entryId":"66247","definition":"具有一定形状的某种物质。","pronunciation":["물건"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/464b854441a01770e775.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n18328-1-9-2","ko":"아버지의 취미가 골동품 수집이라서 그래.","zh":"因为父亲的爱好是收集古董啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아버지의","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"1","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아버지의","audio":"/audio/3e237daf6370fad48d7b.mp3"}},{"text":"취미가","meaning":"爱好，嗜好，趣味，兴趣","explanation":"취미：爱好，嗜好，趣味，兴趣；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"취미","audio":"/audio/fce0e79fcf68c195df88.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72149","senseId":"1","lemma":"취미","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"취미가","audio":"/audio/a0b912ba5fcf1bba700a.mp3"}},{"text":"골동품","meaning":"古董，古玩","explanation":"골동품：古董，古玩。","readings":[{"term":"골동품","audio":"/audio/e2c8d9085247838d8789.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18328","senseId":"1","lemma":"골동품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"골동품","audio":"/audio/e2c8d9085247838d8789.mp3"}},{"text":"수집이라서","meaning":"收集，收藏","explanation":"수집：收集，收藏；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；라서：名词判断或 아니다 后的原因表达：“因为是、因为不是”。","readings":[{"term":"수집","audio":"/audio/84a45227280159ccb0a2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15769","senseId":"1","lemma":"수집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수집이라서","audio":"/audio/b0adcbb652480122a85f.mp3"}},{"text":"그래.","meaning":"那样，就那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样，就那样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"4","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3","entryId":"71343","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的男子。","pronunciation":["아버지"]},{"id":"fce0e79fcf68c195","term":"취미","zh":"爱好，嗜好，趣味，兴趣","audio":"/audio/fce0e79fcf68c195df88.mp3","entryId":"72149","definition":"喜欢而为了乐趣做的事。","pronunciation":["취ː미"]},{"id":"e2c8d9085247838d","term":"골동품","zh":"古董，古玩","audio":"/audio/e2c8d9085247838d8789.mp3","entryId":"18328","definition":"古老、稀奇的旧物。","pronunciation":["골똥품"]},{"id":"84a45227280159cc","term":"수집","zh":"收集，收藏","audio":"/audio/84a45227280159ccb0a2.mp3","entryId":"15769","definition":"为了兴趣或研究而寻找聚集物品或资料等。","pronunciation":["수집"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样，就那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"没有什么特别的变化。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/3657b00213ce7efc5c83.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.322,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=18328","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":159,"sequenceScore":3.1487,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为父亲的爱好是收集古董啊。","哇，能在这样的草原上骑马，肯定特别有趣呢。","你们家好像有很多稀有的物品呢。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["因为父亲的爱好是收集古董啊。","你们家好像有很多稀有的物品呢。","哇，能在这样的草原上骑马，肯定特别有趣呢。"],"answer":0}]}
